--------------------------------------------------------------'\r\n00:00.641  blend            | Read blend: \"D:\\项目session\\blender-supercar\\pipeline\\v4_stage_rig.blend\"\nBlenderMCP addon registered\r\nMat_Brake_HeatGlow blend: BLENDED\r\nDRIVER: nodes[\"Emission\"].inputs[1].default_value expr= heat*9.0\r\n  VAR: heat <bpy_struct, Object(\"RIG_F1_Race\") at 0x000001F632EDB220> [\"brake_heat\"]\r\nRIG DRIVER: pose.bones[\"Bone_Wheel_FL\"].rotation_euler expr= -spin\r\nRIG DRIVER: pose.bones[\"Bone_Wheel_FR\"].rotation_euler expr= -spin\r\nRIG DRIVER: pose.bones[\"Bone_Wheel_RL\"].rotation_euler expr= -spin*slip\r\nRIG DRIVER: pose.bones[\"Bone_Wheel_RR\"].rotation_euler expr= -spin*slip\r\nRIG DRIVER: pose.bones[\"Bone_Hub_FL\"].rotation_euler expr= steer*0.0174532925\r\nRIG DRIVER: pose.bones[\"Bone_Hub_FR\"].rotation_euler expr= steer*0.0174532925\r\nRIG DRIVER: pose.bones[\"Bone_Steering_Wheel\"].rotation_euler expr= steer*ratio*0.0174532925\r\nRIG DRIVER: pose.bones[\"Bone_DRS\"].rotation_euler expr= -0.2792527*drs\r\nRIG DRIVER: pose.bones[\"Bone_Susp_FL\"].location expr= susp\r\nRIG DRIVER: pose.bones[\"Bone_Susp_FR\"].location expr= susp\r\nRIG DRIVER: pose.bones[\"Bone_Susp_RL\"].location expr= susp\r\nRIG DRIVER: pose.bones[\"Bone_Susp_RR\"].location expr= susp\r\nBlenderMCP addon unregistered\r\nBlender 5.3.0 (hash 02f0899d78e3 built 2026-11-10 01:33:43)\n\nBlender quit\n"}
